<section class="page-heading shell"><p class="eyebrow">THE BOOKSHELF</p><h1>作品书架<span class="title-dot">.</span></h1><p>每一个故事，都有它自己的温度。</p></section>
<% site.data.works.forEach((work, index) => { %>
<section class="bookshelf shell"><a class="shelf-cover" href="<%= work.url %>"><img src="<%= work.cover %>" alt="<%= work.title %>，yuanguo 著" width="420" height="590" loading="lazy"></a><div class="shelf-info"><p class="eyebrow"><%= String(index + 1).padStart(2, '0') %> / <%= work.genre %></p><h2><%= work.title %></h2><p class="book-subtitle"><%= work.subtitle %></p><p><%= work.description %></p><div class="tags"><% work.tags.forEach(tag => { %><span><%= tag %></span><% }); %></div><div class="actions"><a class="button primary" href="<%= work.url %>">了解作品 ↗</a><% if (work.reading_url) { %><a class="text-link" href="<%= work.reading_url %>">开始试读 →</a><% } %></div></div></section>
<% }); %>
<section class="quiet-note shell"><span class="small-dot"></span> 新的故事，会在这里慢慢长出来。</section>
